  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 401.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to reimbursement for costs incurred on or after the effective date of this chapter.\n\nSource. #4762, eff 2-13-90; ss by #5115, eff 4-16-91; ss by #5534, eff 12-21-92; ss by #6543, eff 7-22-97; EXPIRED: 7-22-05\n\nNew. #8491, eff 11-22-05; ss by #9935-A, eff 9-1-11, EXPIRED: 9-1-19\n\nNew. #12942, eff 12-15-19",
